# Copy to gradle.properties (which is git-ignored, being machine-specific).
#
# The ACM UI is being migrated from Swing to JavaFX. JavaFX 8 is bundled inside the JDK, and
# not every JDK 8 bundles it -- Oracle JDK 8 does, stock OpenJDK / Temurin / Zulu (non-FX) and
# most Corretto builds do not. The build fails with an explanation if the JDK it runs on lacks
# JavaFX. Point it at one that has it:
#
#   org.gradle.java.home=C:/Program Files/Java/jdk1.8.0_202
#
# Use forward slashes even on Windows. To check a candidate JDK:
#   ls "<jdk>/jre/lib/ext/jfxrt.jar"
